                  <story-point caption='The Battery Technology Landscape&#10;&#10;NMC and LFP account for the largest numbers of distinct vehicle IDs in this dataset. This indicates that these technologies are well represented in the available records. Vehicle counts alone do not establish global market share or determine which battery technology performs best.' captured-sheet='Battery Technology Distribution' id='1' />
